{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Complete the suppressed branch with an observable outcome.** When early parent completion wins, this only completes the future. A retained FLAT branch future then has neither a cached result nor an `Operation` and can dereference null; a nested branch can read its stale `STARTED` record. This path also omits `onOperationEnd` for virtual branches. Cache a failed/skipped result and fire the virtual end hook before marking completion, with a race test that calls the retained branch future.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7on8vx","finding_digest":"a4a0de8f8a28f4914044834e2ac9cd75891cdd7d701513632e0698bfdb9f3680","finding_id":"arf_v1_usqn5d4kfd2jcqceqnhcvsonow","finding_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::executechildcontext::post-completion-payload-failure","identity_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::executechildcontext::post-completion-payload-failure","line":155,"observation_digest":"a6f1a104072d6050fadf410c0a9d621f874f335700ef01493df703409e1cb589","observation_id":"aro_v1_u3y2cbahfvqfb6w7iegavhlcd6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_usqn5d4kfd2jcqceqnhcvsonow","published_at":"2026-09-01T09:35:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f7yfwsfn3t3ip6mxezvhkmn3pj","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"620892fae3e68f10de7e8a66278e9d7c5965ee5f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":151,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_fqe7dwfb2fbjcrk4ejp5u4rufb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T09:35:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
